- renderer-only length limits will stop discarding records accepted by current producers;
- each validator and both hostile-ID event paths will get independent browser proof.

These changes invalidate the prior verifier/review snapshot, so the affected browser/UI checks and then the formal verifier will run again before a fresh code review.

